<title>USA: Air-Cure gets clearance for Ohmstede deal.</title>
<headline>Air-Cure gets clearance for Ohmstede deal.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air-Cure Technologies Inc said Moonday that the Federal Trade Commission has notified the company of early termination of the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Act for Air-Cure's pending acquisition of Ohmstede Inc.</p>
<p>The company said that financing for the transaction is being finalized and that it expects the acquisition to close within the next few weeks.</p>
</text>
